<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Communication from Tarikul Islam</title>
</head>

<body
    style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'timesnuroman', 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.8;">

    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
        style="max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto; padding:10px 5px 20px 5px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="border-bottom: 2px solid #00c896; padding-bottom: 8px;">
                            <div
                                style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px;">
                                Tarikul Islam
                            </div>
                            <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #666; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px;">
                                Full-Stack Developer & Software Engineer
                            </div>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top: 40px;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="font-size: 14px;">
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 20px;">Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>

                            <p style="margin: 0 0 20px;">
                                Thank you for reaching out. This is to acknowledge that I have received your message
                                regarding our
                                potential collaboration.
                            </p>

                            <p style="margin: 0 0 20px;">
                                I am currently reviewing the details you provided. A thoughtful response requires
                                careful consideration,
                                so I appreciate your patience while I examine how my expertise can best align with your
                                requirements.
                            </p>

                            <p style="margin: 0 0 20px;">
                                I will get back to you shortly with the next steps. In the interim, should you have any
                                additional
                                information to share, please feel free to reply to this email.
                            </p>

                            <p style="margin: 0px 0 2px;">Sincerely,</p>
                            <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px;">Tarikul Islam</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                    style="margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; padding-top: 20px;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #888888;">
                            <p style="margin: 0;">
                                Portfolio: <a href="{{frontendUrl}}"
                                    style="color: #004a99; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">Tarikul Islam</a>
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin: 5px 0 0;">Dhaka, Bangladesh</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

</body>

</html>